{
  "_comment": [
    "Brand-level charging tariffs for Turkish networks, in TRY per kWh, VAT included.",
    "Turkish operators publish one national tariff per socket class (AC / DC), so a",
    "brand-level table is accurate for the great majority of stations. Where an operator",
    "runs several tariffs the min and max are both recorded and the app shows a RANGE,",
    "never an invented exact price. A brand with no verified figure gets no price at all.",
    "",
    "tools/build_turkey.py refreshes these numbers on every run from the dated public",
    "tariff index at https://www.doviz.com/ev-sarj-fiyatlari and falls back to the values",
    "committed here when that fetch fails, so a broken scrape can never blank out prices.",
    "Operator-published cross-check: https://cms.esarj.com/api/pricing/tariffs (Eşarj).",
    "",
    "Keys are the NORMALISED brand: lowercase, Turkish letters folded to ASCII, spaces and",
    "punctuation stripped, so they match EPDK's free-text 'marka' values. 'aliases'",
    "carries the other spellings the same network is registered under.",
    "",
    "This file is pipeline INPUT, never a Flutter asset: assets/ is on the Codemagic iOS",
    "build-trigger allow-list (see CLAUDE.md), and this file changes often."
  ],
